.DATA
VT@A: 

DW lbl_setX@A
DW lbl_printX@A

.CODE
lbl_setX@A: LOADFP
LOADSP
STOREFP
LOAD 4
LOAD 3
SWAP
STOREREF 2
lbl_final_setX@A: NOP
STOREFP
