VT@Init: 
NOP

.CODE
lbl_main@Init: LOADFP
LOADSP
STOREFP
RMEM 2
RMEM 1
PUSH 3
PUSH simple_malloc
CALL
DUP
PUSH VT@A
STOREREF 0
